  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestine Strategy Group: Collective Strategic Thinking 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s expected effect on society is increased readiness and capacity for Palestinian input into principled negotiations and conflict resolution. The Israel-Palestine conflict thus becomes less intractable. (Impact).
The expected effects for the target group of the Project (Outcome) are
1)The rapidly increasing global threat to Palestinian rights as posed by Christian Zionist doctrines implicating Spirit-centred Christians&#x2019; faith, from the United States to the Global South is analysed and strategically assessed.
2) Collective strategic thinking on augmenting US protestant and evangelicals&#x2019; politics vis-&#xe0;-vis Palestinian rights is developed and made actionable.
3) A collective Palestinian (including Palestinian-Christian) strategic response based on principles of Palestinian self-determination and justice is crafted.</narrative>
  </description>
